tage_lookdev.blend` -> saves `v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_anim_sv.blend`):\n   - **Safe \"On Twos\" (12 fps) Animation Rhythm (ZERO Chase-Cam Judder!)**:\n     * Keep world-space `Bone_Root` location, `Bone_Heading` rotation, `V5_CamFocus`, and ALL 26 camera transforms smooth on **24 fps** (`LINEAR`) so the car never teleports 3.8m every other frame in chase cameras!\n     * Step car-local secondary motion on **Twos (12 fps `CONSTANT` hold every 2 frames)**: `Bone_Body` pitch/roll, `Bone_Steering_Wheel` / front wheel steer, suspension bones, shift LEDs, brake glow pulses, and `V6_09_ComicFX` aero vortex ribbon flutter & wheel smear arcs (toggle/scale aero ribbons on when `v > 230 km/h` and boost when `drs >= 0.5`!). Lower `motion_blur_shutter = 0.07` for crisp hand-drawn comic frames.\n   - **3-Act Dimensional Color Script + Portal Transitions + Impact Frames**:\n     * Act I (`f=1..788`, `S01..S09`): `sv_dimension = 0.0` (Earth-1610 Miles classic graphic comic dusk);\n     * Act II (`f=789..1601`, `S09b..S18`): `sv_dimension = 1.0` (Earth-65 Gwen expressionist teal/magenta watercolor);\n     * Act III (`f=1602..2161`, `S19..S26`): `sv_dimension = 2.0` (Earth-928 2099 cyber obsidian/ultraviolet + neon red);\n     * Add 2-frame **Dimensional Glitch Spikes** across universe cuts (`f=788..790` and `f=1601..1603`), PLUS 2-frame **Black/White/Crimson Graphic Impact Frames** at `f=1698..1699` (Stowe 331 km/h heavy-braking slam inside Clip 3!) and `f=312..313` (Village hairpin heavy braking).\n   - **Blender 5.3 Multi-Pass Compositor (`Comp_V6_SpiderVerse`)**:\n     * Enable ViewLayer passes: `use_pass_normal=True`, `use_pass_mist=True` (`mist_settings`: start `12m`, depth `160m`), `use_pass_z=True`, `use_pass_emit=True`, `use_pass_cryptomatte_object=True`.\n     * **Anisotropic Kuwahara Painterly Background**: `CompositorNodeKuwahara` applied to background via `Mist` mask (subtle in Act I/III, strong painterly brush wash in Act II Gwen world!), keeping foreground hero car 100